From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Turcios <turcioskevinr@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:05:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Face Swap: average several source photos, expose sharpness

Vendored Deep-Live-Cam: LiveConfig.source_paths takes more photos of the
same person; the live pipeline averages their face embeddings (one photo
behaves exactly as before; unreadable photos are skipped and reported
once). On held-out frames, 4 source photos raised identity similarity
from 0.785 to 0.810 (worst target 0.731 -> 0.762) at no per-frame cost.

Face Swap tab: the source is now a gallery of photos (old single-photo
settings migrate), and the existing unsharp-mask "sharpness" option is
exposed as a slider.

Applio-Commit: 8cd50f972ecbea17fbb332664064e97c3a749985
---
 _vendor/modules/globals.py |  1 +
 _vendor/modules/live.py    | 95 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 75 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

